 in 1958."]},{"t0":17.0,"dur":129.03,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":146.03,"dur":19.5,"zh":["左前方是肯亞的安博塞利，1974 年設為國家公園。","公園面積 392 平方公里，以象群聞名。","園中的安博塞利湖，平時多半是乾涸的鹼性湖盆。"],"en":["Ahead on the left: Kenya's Amboseli, a national park since 1974.","The park covers 392 square kilometres and is known for its elephants.","Lake Amboseli in its midst is usually a dry, alkaline basin."],"poi":"amboseli"},{"t0":165.53,"dur":34.5,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":200.03,"dur":19.5,"zh":["左側是吉力馬札羅山，最高點烏呼魯峰海拔 5,895 公尺。","從山腳到山頂，海拔上升超過五千公尺。","1912 到 2011 年間，山上的冰減少了將近 85%。"],"en":["On the left: Mount Kilimanjaro; its summit, Uhuru Peak, stands 5,895 m above the sea.","From foot to summit, the mountain climbs more than 5,000 m.","Between 1912 and 2011 it lost almost 85 per cent of its ice."],"poi":"kibo"},{"t0":219.53,"dur":0.6,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":220.13,"dur":13.0,"zh":["基博峰東邊的馬文濟峰，海拔 5,149 公尺。","1987 年，吉力馬札羅國家公園列入世界遺產。"],"en":["East of Kibo, Mawenzi reaches 5,149 m.","Kilimanjaro National Park joined the World Heritage List in 1987."],"poi":"mawenzi"},{"t0":233.13,"dur":20.69,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":253.82,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右側是梅魯山，海拔 4,562 公尺，阿魯沙國家公園的中心。","它在吉力馬札羅以西約 70 公里，1910 年曾小規模噴發。"],"en":["On the right: Mount Meru, 4,562 m, the centrepiece of Arusha National Park.","About 70 km west of Kilimanjaro, it last erupted, slightly, in 1910."],"poi":"meru"},{"t0":266.82,"dur":17.18,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":284.0,"dur":6.5,"zh":["降落吉力馬札羅國際機場，海拔 894 公尺，1971 年啟用。"],"en":["Landing at Kilimanjaro International Airport, 894 m up, opened in 1971."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"起飛：喬莫·肯亞塔國際機場","en":"Takeoff: Jomo Kenyatta International Airport"},{"t":68.18,"tt":791,"kind":"toc","zh":"爬升至巡航高度 19,000 呎","en":"Top of climb, 19,000 ft"},{"t":128.05,"tt":1437,"kind":"tod","zh":"開始下降","en":"Top of descent"},{"t":154.8,"tt":1670,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 25 公里：安博塞利","en":"Amboseli, 25 km left","k":"amboseli"},{"t":208.8,"tt":2268,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 33 公里：吉力馬札羅山","en":"Kilimanjaro, 33 km left","k":"kibo"},{"t":219.2,"tt":2311,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 45 公里：馬文濟峰","en":"Mawenzi, 45 km left","k":"mawenzi"},{"t":259.67,"tt":2503,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 35 公里：梅魯山","en":"Mount Meru, 35 km right","k":"meru"},{"t":300.0,"tt":3000,"kind":"arr","zh":"降落：吉力馬札羅國際機場","en":"Landing: Kilimanjaro International Airport"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：航路取兩機場間的大圓航線，高度、速度與時間依一般客機爬升下降推算，並非實際航班紀錄；大部分雲層已移除。","en":"Simulation: a great-circle path between the airports, with height, speed and times estimated from typical airliner climbs and descents. Not a real flight record; most clouds are removed."},"geo_src":"great circle between the airports","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Jomo Kenyatta International Airport","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/JKIA"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Mount Kilimanjaro","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Kilimanjaro"},{"title":"UNESCO World Heritage Centre: Kilimanjaro National Park","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/403"},{"title":"NASA Earth Observatory: The Zones of Kilimanjaro","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/the-zones-of-kilimanjaro-89605/"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Mount Meru (Tanzania)","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/Mount_Meru_(Tanzania)"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Kilimanjaro International Airport","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kilimanjaro_International_Airport"},{"title":"Britannica: Amboseli National Park","url":"https://www.britannica.com/place/Amboseli-National-Park"}]}